  "title": "Introducing Resourcerer: Declarative React Data-Fetching for REST APIs",
  "summary": "We are excited to announce the public release of a package we’ve been using internally at Sift to handle our client-side data fetching for over two years now: resourcerer. Resourcerer contains a React higher-order component (HOC) called withResources that allows you to easily and declaratively manage your components’ data flows, while also handling loading states […]",
